00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:31.480
Now they have to pay to use those online features, but that's not what we're here, we're not here to anger anybody.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:48.900
We'd like to talk about the NES online mode of it, which is a free download as long as you're a Nintendo Switch online member, which is $20 a year for the Nintendo Switch online, which I don't think is a bad deal at all personally, but let's see if it's worth the value to you.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.940
The current games, guys, you get 20 games so far.

00:00:53.660 --> 00:01:04.800
Three more will be coming each month, so I think that's important to note that this is kind of like a Netflix thing, except for there's no indication that the games are going to expire, you know, like that they're going to fall out of the system.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:28.380
Sure. So the 20 games right now, baseball, tennis, Excitebike, Ice Climber, Super Mario Bros., Donkey Kong, Mario Bros., Balloon Fight, Ghost and Goblins, Gradius, Pro Wrestling, Soccer, The Legend of Zelda, Double Dragon, Ice Hockey, Tecmo Bowl, River City Ransom, Super Mario Bros.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:29.620
3, Dr.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:30.900
Mario, and Yoshi.

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:34.980
Now, we've covered a surprising amount of those games already.

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:38.280
Very skewed to the launch titles.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:39.720
Yeah, very skewed to the launch titles.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:43.640
I think I count 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 right now.

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:47.580
6 launch titles out of the 17 that came with the NES launch.

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:48.980
Joe, what are your feelings?

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:50.780
Would you invest in something like this?

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:58.080
Well, I mean, I think just of those games that you listed, which this is the first time I'm hearing this list, but I haven't played a lot of them.

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:03.420
