00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:04.480
Like, again, like that.

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:08.920
In your bed. Yeah. And that's out of 20, some of which of the ones that I didn't count, I don't know.

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:09.940
