00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:43.900
Yeah. I do think that there is some value there, but I do think that any time that there is something that was free and is no longer free, even though they're adding on this NES thing, I would still be a little salty about that.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:49.320
Gotcha. And I think that it's a very reasonable price, but it's a principal thing.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.420
You know what I mean? Mm-hmm.

00:02:51.660 --> 00:03:02.700
So, yeah, I think that I'm going to pay for the service, and I will enjoy these NES games, and I don't think that I'll ever cancel it.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:07.940
I will say that it's strange that it goes from free to paid.

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:09.880
Yeah. Here's the thing that's weird.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:13.820
You can never own these games, presumably, on your Switch.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:17.220
Unlike the Wii U where you were able to buy Super Mario Bros.

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:20.040
and then have it, and you can still play it today.

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:26.740
There's essentially an eventual expiration date to you having all of these awesome NES games on your Switch.

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:29.740
Yeah. That's also a thing.

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:43.840
I'm just thinking of the fact that, and I might have this wrong of the way it actually works, but I don't have a Switch, but I remember when I had the PS3 before PS4 came out and stuff, the online wasn't too great, and it was free.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:47.720
But now that you pay for online, I feel like they've put a lot more work into it.

00:03:47.820 --> 00:04:00.720
It's a little more polished and everything, and I think, I don't know, not to defend the decision to just suddenly make something that you were getting for free paid, but I think that they maybe try and get an install base by making it free.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:03.300
Similar to, I think, Spotify did this when it first came out.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:04.820
You could just listen to anything for free.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:07.660
