00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:12.940
Yeah, I think it was a very generous time period that you were playing free online.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:17.980
I mean, both Sony and Microsoft don't offer a free online experience.

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:19.960
Not anymore. But I don't think we're here to talk about the online.

