So this way you can, you know, kind of be, you know, a scum and do some – and then play games the way they weren't intended and try to beat them in multiple sittings instead of in one.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:54.120
And there's also, like, an interesting mapping to the controller, too, where it's the back two.

