It's Y and B instead of X and A.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.960
Fun. Yeah. But, hey, whatever.

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:12.180
And correct me if I'm wrong, but is there – isn't there a feature now to – if I'm playing Legend of Zelda, a one-player game, I can play with you, Mike, somewhere else.

